==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 46.67~93.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 170 seconds<sup>5,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 220 seconds<sup>6,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Ultimate Bondage Cat (Enemy)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]] spawns after 266.67 seconds<sup>8,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage revolves around keeping a high defense and chipping the Ultimate Bondage Cat's health before they get to stack. [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] are great attackers for this stage, and the [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cats]] are great meatshields to pair with their [[Cat (Normal Cat)|normal]] [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|variants]].

